565 113 gm
0.56884 0. 32 0.05688 0.(Engineering, Toronto, Ontario, Canada, July 1995, pp 206 - 214. Also appeared)awidthshow
577 113 gm
1.19003 0. 32 0.11900 0.(in proceedings of 2nd Working Conference on Reverse Engineering, Toronto,)awidthshow
589 113 gm
(Ontario, Canada, July 1995.)show
613 85 gm
